//! Per-row bookkeeping for the minimap.

/// Horizontal extent of the non-blank content of one minimap row, measured in
/// (byte based) source columns, before horizontal scaling.
///
/// `beg` is the byte offset of the first non-whitespace character and `end`
/// is one past the byte offset at which the last non-whitespace character
/// starts.  A row which has only seen blank lines keeps `beg == usize::MAX`
/// (so it never widens the start when merged with real content) and
/// `end == 1`, which gives blank rows a nominal width of a single column.
#[derive(Clone, Copy, Debug, PartialEq, Eq)]
