//! Query the size of the terminal attached to a file descriptor.
//!
//! This is a small, self-contained replacement for the `terminal_size`
//! crate exposing the same public API surface that is needed for help text
//! wrapping: [`terminal_size`] looks at standard output, [`terminal_size_of`]
